# secrets (FR-11)
.env

# data/chroma/ is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the prebuilt vector store
# (5.9 MB) and deploy targets such as Render need it in the image, because
# their runtime filesystem is ephemeral and the start command must not ingest.
# Rebuild it with `python -m src.ingest` and commit the result.
#
# other ingested artifacts, rebuilt on demand and not needed to answer queries
data/raw/
data/embeddings.txt

